  "description": "Construction of a single storey rear outbuilding",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The scale, massing and overall footprint of the proposed outbuilding would result in a dominant and disproportionate form of development within the rear amenity area of the subject site, would not be consistent with the existing character and built form of the area, and is of a size that fails to convincingly demonstrate ancillary use.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;As such, the proposal is contrary to:&amp;nbsp;- National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (MHCLG, 2024)- Policy D4 of the London Plan (March 2021);- The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012);- Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of&amp;nbsp;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037: (September 2024)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
